                                                "sense_id": "4a2163d5-2c66-3002-8472-ce1dce76ca22",
                                                "text": "1998, Karl Xydexx Jorgensen, in alt.fan.furry http://groups.google.com/group/alt.fan.furry/msg/1a213152a9bb5836?dmode=source&hl=en\nOoh, vorarephilia. What's eating me? A big wolfy, prolly. I'm everyone's favorite chew-toy."
