                                                "example_id": "e9c744df-5b27-411b-9ab5-b8b3a56630ec",
                                                "sense_id": "4a2163d5-2c66-3002-8472-ce1dce76ca22",
                                                "text": "1999, Kevin Alexander Cosmic, in alt.fan.vore http://groups.google.com/group/alt.fan.vore/msg/b0833972db5377ca?dmode=source&hl=en\nA place to discuss vorarephilia... Why, I am right on topic here, my kind of place, and not even any competing predators to snatch my prey away while I play with it, harrr harrr harrrr!"
                                            },
